# Initial gptokeyb mapping for the DDLC PortMaster wrapper.
#
# gptokeyb syntax can vary between PortMaster environments. Treat this as a
# structured starter profile and adjust after testing on the target device.
#
# Goals:
#   A      -> Enter / click
#   B      -> Escape or Backspace
#   D-Pad  -> Arrow keys
#   Start  -> Escape / menu; virtual keyboard treats it as OK
#   Select -> F9; opens the large quick panel, cancels virtual keyboard
#   X      -> F10; opens the fake file manager globally, Space in keyboard
#   Y      -> H; Ren'Py hide text globally, Case toggle in keyboard
#   L/R    -> PageUp/PageDown for rollback/advance style navigation

a = enter
b = backspace
x = f10
y = h
start = escape
select = f9
up = up
down = down
left = left
right = right
l1 = pageup
r1 = pagedown
l2 = pageup
r2 = pagedown
